<title>USA: U.S. corn gluten pellets flat, meal unchanged-down.</title>
<headline>U.S. corn gluten pellets flat, meal unchanged-down.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corn gluten pellet values were unchanged and meal prices were flat to lower Monday in &quot;fairly quiet trade,&quot; a cash source said.</p>
<p>--</p>
<p>    CHICAGO AREA MILLS (dollars/short ton)   Today	 Prev</p>
<p>Gluten feed 21 pct bulk	    Spot     -     unq   -   unq</p>
<p>Gluten feed pellets		  Spot     -   78.00     78.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk rail     Spot     -  348.00    350.00</p>
<p>DECATUR, IL/CLINTON AND CEDAR RAPIDS, IA</p>
<p>Gluten feed 18 pct pellets	 Spot     -   75.00     75.00</p>
<p>Gluten meal 60 pct bulk	    Spot     -  340.00    340.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
